Suddenly, the reed is being moved apart and a scary painted face appears right in front of you, then another one! It would seem that your surprise deadly attack should have made you look like dreadful opponents in the eyes of the savages, almost equal to gods, but it seems they have courage. They certainly won't stand under your fire, like targets in a shooting gallery!

Swearing, Conan takes new rounds, trying to reload the rifle with shaking hands... And all of a sudden, he falls, making a death rattle. A short javelin protrudes from his side. You don't have time to do anything before a second spear hits your chest, and everything goes dark before your eyes. Your adventure ends here.